{"id":"a4bf1b217b254fc2c7c017d0376690cbf332b757","url":"https://incconutwo.com/","title":"incconu_two — Personal Website","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"incconutwo.com","byline":"incconu_two","excerpt":"Official website of incconu_two (@tnemoroccan). Developer of privacy-focused and UX-enhancing browser extensions like Twitter Location Flags and Gemini Cleaner.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><DIV><!-- Hero Section --><div id=\"hero\"><!-- Left Side: Text Content --><div><!-- Headline --><div><h2><p><span>Hello everyone,</span></p><p><span id=\"scramble-1\">I am</span></p><p><span id=\"scramble-2\">incconu_two</span></p></h2></div><!-- Bio Paragraph --><p>16-year-old student &amp; independent developer based in Morocco (1st Bac), building browser extensions, Windows customizations mods, web apps, and many more. I've been online since late 2024 and am quite active in real life, doing a lot of different sports and activities. I'm the typical 'tech guy' at school, and I love music—all of it. New week, new music style, and this is my personal page for everything I do online and offline :-&gt;</p><!-- Projects CTA Button --><a href=\"/#projects-section\"><span>View Projects</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 13h11.83l-5.59 5.59L12 20l8-8-8-8-1.41 1.41 5.59 5.59H5v2z\" /></svg></a></div><!-- Right Side: Profile Image --><div><P><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-title\"><title id=\"profile-title\">Profile Picture with Blob Effect</title><defs><clippath id=\"pe-blob-clip\"><path d=\"M43.1,-68.5C56.2,-58.6,67.5,-47.3,72.3,-33.9C77.2,-20.5,75.5,-4.9,74.2,11.3C72.9,27.6,71.9,44.5,63.8,57.2C55.7,69.8,40.6,78.2,25.5,79.2C10.4,80.1,-4.7,73.6,-20.9,69.6C-37.1,65.5,-54.5,63.9,-66,54.8C-77.5,45.8,-83.2,29.3,-85.7,12.3C-88.3,-4.8,-87.7,-22.3,-79.6,-34.8C-71.5,-47.3,-55.8,-54.9,-41.3,-64.2C-26.7,-73.6,-13.4,-84.7,0.8,-86C15,-87.2,29.9,-78.5,43.1,-68.5Z\" transform=\"translate(100 100)\