ng.\"Thanks to my parents for everything","fetched_at":"2026-08-07T00:03:51.863Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<h2><p><span>Hello everyone,</span></p><p><span id=\"scramble-1\">I am</span></p><p><span id=\"scramble-2\">incconu_two</span></p></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Hello everyone,I amincconu_two","zh":"大家好，我是incconu_two"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Hello everyone,</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Hello everyone,","zh":"大家好，"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span id=\"scramble-1\">I am</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span id=\"scramble-2\">incconu_two</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"incconu_two","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>16-year-old student &amp; independent developer based in Morocco (1st Bac), building browser extensions, Windows customizations mods, web apps, and many more. I've been online since late 2024 and am quite active in real life, doing a lot of different sports and activities. I'm the typical 'tech guy' at school, and I love music—all of it. New week, new music style, and this is my personal page for everything I do online and offline :-&gt;</p>","sentences":[{"en":"16-year-old student & independent developer based in Morocco (1st Bac), building browser extensions, Windows customizations mods, web apps, and many more.","zh":"16 岁的学生兼独立开发者，居住在摩洛哥 (1st Bac)，负责构建浏览器扩展、Windows 自定义 mod、网络应用程序等。"},{"en":"I've been online since late 2024 and am quite active in real life, doing a lot of different sports and activities.","zh":"我自 2024 年底开始上网，在现实生活中也非常活跃，参加了许多不同的运动和活动。"},{"en":"I'm the typical 'tech guy' at school, and I love music—all of it.","zh":"我是学校里典型的“科技人”，我喜欢音乐——所有的一切。"},{"en":"New week, new music style, and this is my personal page for everything I do online and offline :->","zh":"新的一周，新的音乐风格，这是我在线和离线所做的一切的个人页面:->"}]},{"html_en":"<p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-title\"><title id=\"profile-title\">Profile Picture with Blob Effect</title><defs><clippath id=\"pe-blob-clip\"><path d=\"M43.1,-68.5C